# Allowlist: the server image (apps/server/Dockerfile) only needs these. Everything else,
# including .env files, HAR captures, fixtures and the desktop app, stays out of the context.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!tsconfig.base.json
!apps/server
!packages/shared
!packages/scraper
!data/degrees

# Never sent, even from inside the allowlisted directories. Stale tsbuildinfo without dist
# would make `tsc -b` think it's up to date and emit nothing.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env*
**/*.har
**/*.log
**/coverage
